msgstr ""
"FoxIO. *JA4+ Network Fingerprinting*. https://github.com/FoxIO-LLC/ja4, "
"2023 (der JA4-Fingerabdruck von TLS-Clients)."

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/glossary.rst:208
msgid ""
"Einziger, G., Friedman, R., and Manes, B. \"TinyLFU: a highly efficient "
