msgstr ""
"Einziger, G., Friedman, R., und Manes, B. „TinyLFU: a highly efficient "
"cache admission policy.“ *ACM Transactions on Storage* 13(4), 2017."

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/glossary.rst:209
msgid ""
