"*NSDI*, 2016."
msgstr ""
"Eisenbud, D. E., Yi, C., Contavalli, C., Smith, C., Kononov, R., "
"Mann-Hielscher, E., Cilingiroglu, A., Cheyney, B., Shang, W., und Hosein, "
"J. D. „Maglev: a fast and reliable software network load balancer.“ "
"*NSDI*, 2016."

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/glossary.rst:210
msgid ""
"Hanson, N. \"libinjection: SQL injection detection by tokenization.\" "
"Black Hat USA, 2012."
msgstr ""
"Hanson, N. „libinjection: SQL injection detection by tokenization.“ Black "
"Hat USA, 2012."

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/glossary.rst:211
msgid ""
"Juels, A., and Brainard, J. \"Client puzzles: a cryptographic "
"countermeasure against connection depletion attacks.\" *NDSS*, 1999."
msgstr ""
"Juels, A., und Brainard, J. „Client puzzles: a cryptographic "
"countermeasure against connection depletion attacks.“ *NDSS*, 1999."

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/glossary.rst:212
msgid ""
"Lamport, L. \"The part-time parliament.\" *ACM Transactions on Computer "
"Systems* 16(2), 1998; and \"Paxos made simple.\" *ACM SIGACT News* 32(4), "
"2001."
msgstr ""
"Lamport, L. „The part-time parliament.“ *ACM Transactions on Computer "
"Systems* 16(2), 1998; und „Paxos made simple.“ *ACM SIGACT News* 32(4), "
"2001."

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/glossary.rst:213
msgid ""
"Mahmoody, M., Moran, T., and Vadhan, S. \"Publicly verifiable proofs of "
"sequential work.\" *Innovations in Theoretical Computer Science (ITCS)*, "
"2013."
